# Issue #83: small paper-like shapes for the scalar-packing correctness pass (config_paper_correctness.json).
# The full paper set (B1-B5, S1-S5) is too big for the scalar oracle (O(m*n*k); B2 limit, docs/agents/execution.md
# "Correctness pass"). B2 and B3 are the paper's own shapes at the limit; Sq200 is a square one with fringe rows and
# columns at every tile of the 19 (200 is not a multiple of 16, 24 or 32, nor of most NR).
# layer  M     N     K
B2       384   384   64
B3       64    384   384
Sq200    200   200   200
